565
00:47:48,644 --> 00:47:54,890
Speaker 1: But it was, there was, there was, you know, a healthy scattering of people all about the room, uh, in a room I didn't even know existed.

566
00:47:56,272 --> 00:47:57,640
Speaker 0: I didn't know that this room existed either.

567
00:47:57,680 --> 00:48:01,216
Speaker 0: I walk in, it's like an actual theater with theater seating in a real stage.

568
00:48:02,039 --> 00:48:02,200
Speaker 1: Yeah.

569
00:48:02,220 --> 00:48:03,746
Speaker 1: It's like, Whoa, what's that room doing here?

570
00:48:03,766 --> 00:48:04,247
Speaker 1: Yeah.

571
00:48:04,609 --> 00:48:08,989
