572
00:48:09,009 --> 00:48:09,129
Speaker 0: Yep.

573
00:48:09,471 --> 00:48:16,380
Speaker 0: But the panel content overall, like, you know, the thing that we seek out, there were panels I put on my schedule that I wanted to go to.

574
00:48:16,421 --> 00:48:20,056
