Speaker 1: I mean, anytime I went past the panel room, there were people, you know, lining up.

583
00:49:04,898 --> 00:49:07,587
Speaker 1: So it was, I'm sure I know, I don't know all of them.

584
00:49:07,647 --> 00:49:10,260
Speaker 1: Cause I, it's not like I could go around that much and investigate.

585
00:49:10,300 --> 00:49:13,814
Speaker 1: It was just, you know, what I, from what I saw, that's how it was going.

586
00:49:13,895 --> 00:49:14,075
Speaker 1: Yup.

