Speaker 0: He basically said, Oh, thank God I can see another table.

598
00:49:51,067 --> 00:49:52,995
Speaker 0: Cause there was already a line outside.

599
00:49:53,517 --> 00:49:59,459
Speaker 1: If you're not going to use that copy of the game to teach the game, then that means six more people can come in and play.

600
00:49:59,480 --> 00:49:59,540
Speaker 1: Yup.

601
00:50:00,624 --> 00:50:05,742
