602
00:50:05,762 --> 00:50:10,738
Speaker 0: Uh, we seated 72 people in the room for the workshop divided by six.

603
00:50:10,778 --> 00:50:12,824
Speaker 1: is what, you know, 12, 12 counts.

604
00:50:12,864 --> 00:50:15,692
Speaker 1: Yeah, I think.

605
00:50:16,014 --> 00:50:17,058
Speaker 0: And they turn people away.

606
00:50:17,179 --> 00:50:21,576
Speaker 0: Like, uh, I get the, it sounds like for almost all these learning plays, a lot of people got turned away,

607
00:50:22,399 --> 00:50:29,151
Speaker 1: but it's like, we could have had 15 or 20 copies and that would have more people would have been able to play and come in and it would have filled right.

608
00:50:29,171 --> 00:50:30,074
