609
00:50:31,157 --> 00:50:33,363
Speaker 0: So it's like, but I have two lessons there.

610
00:50:33,523 --> 00:50:39,903
Speaker 0: One, I am super confident a learn and play room could exist at all.

611
00:50:39,923 --> 00:50:43,940
Speaker 0: the other packs is and similarly fill like, even though those packs is not tabletop focus.

612
00:50:44,021 --> 00:50:53,117
