Speaker 1: Yep.

635
00:52:36,623 --> 00:52:36,723
Speaker 1: Yep.

636
00:52:36,743 --> 00:52:42,200
Speaker 0: Despite the crowds, like nothing was too agro.

637
00:52:42,220 --> 00:52:43,765
Speaker 0: The crowds were super well behaved.

638
00:52:44,387 --> 00:52:47,058
Speaker 0: It was very dense, but it wasn't really a problem.

