00:53:11,937 --> 00:53:14,670
Speaker 1: And it's like you have to, you can only enter at like the ends of the con.

645
00:53:14,770 --> 00:53:17,848
Speaker 1: You can't enter in the middle, which is be the most convenient place to enter.

646
00:53:19,871 --> 00:53:22,784
Speaker 1: And they strictly limit like these are exits only.

