00:56:40,973 --> 00:56:41,776
Speaker 0: They actually might.

687
00:56:41,796 --> 00:56:47,475
Speaker 0: I think just for the space, partly because the culture of Pax Unplugged, just polling attendees.

688
00:56:47,496 --> 00:56:50,247
