00:58:09,229 --> 00:58:09,831
Speaker 1: To play an RP.

711
00:58:09,951 --> 00:58:12,360
Speaker 1: Oh, that makes sense to do that.

712
00:58:12,480 --> 00:58:17,738
Speaker 0: But my train home, which was a different train from Scott's train home completely sold out.

